    - rid: 1021519535466610688
      type: {class: DialogueDisplayInfo, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogue:
        - First things first, you wont be able to save the game until the tournament
          ends.
        - You will face a 4 opponents depending on who beats who.
        - The format is a classic tournament bracket.
        - You have the choice of using your own pokemon if they meet the level requiremnt,
        - or you can use the randomized set of pokemon.
        - Every enemy you face will be randomized and as challening as possible.
        - 'If you manage to win all 3 rounds, you will get various prizes. '
        - During the tournament battles, check your bag as you will receive some
          battle items to aid you each round.
        - Go speak to that man to enter the tournament.
